<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani cotton rates hold steady, seen stable.</title>
<headline>Pakistani cotton rates hold steady, seen stable.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani cotton rates closed steady on Tuesday with little buying by spinners, dealers said. Prices were seen opening unchanged on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In the kerb market, NIAB-78 variety was quoted at 2,360 to 2,365 rupees per maund (37.32 kg), K-68 at 2,555 to 2,560 and MNH-93 at 2,565 to 2,570, one dealer said.</p>
